#require "storage.eflint".
#require "access.eflint".
#require "gdpr.eflint".

Extend Fact processor Derived from consent.processor
Extend Fact subject Derived from consent.subject

Fact consent Identified by subject * processor * resource

Act give-consent Recipient processor Related to resource
  Creates consent(subject = actor)
  Holds when owner-of(owner = actor) // only owners of resources can give consent

Act revoke-consent Recipient processor Related to resource
  Terminates consent(subject = actor)
  Holds when owner-of(owner = actor) // only owners of resources can revoke consent

// consent implies read access
Extend Act read Holds when consent(processor = actor, resource = resource )
                        && owner-of(owner = subject)
